al Site Visit  Raghav Utopia\n\nVirtual Site visit\n\nRaghav Utopia Logo\n\nAbout Raghav Group\n\nRaghav Group is a real estate developer, driven by the vision of thoughtfully designed homes with care and quality. Their focus relies on value orientation and liveability. Since 2014, the developer has been transforming land parcels into architectural masterpieces across the city. It has also expanded its horizon in Pune and has several ongoing projects under its record.","score":0.8018276,"raw_content":null,"id":"993518-03"},{"url":"https://housiey.com/projects/raghav-utopia","title":"Raghav Utopia Goregaon west- Brochure, Pros&Cons, PriceSheet","content":"The following legal documents are available on Housiey: Commencement Certificate, Legal Title Report, Layout Plan, Proforma Allotment Letter, Proforma Sale Agreement. You can preview them directly on the project page or verify them independently on the official RERA portal using RERA number PR1180002501406.\n\nThis project offers 11+ amenities. Key external amenities include Multi purpose hall, Gymnasium, Seating Area, Yoga Zone, and Senior Citizen Area.  \n Internal specifications include CCTV Camera and Granite Kitchen Platform. The complete amenities list is available on Housiey.\n\nMonthly maintenance details are available in the price sheet. You can download it from the project page on Housiey. [...] Raghav Goregaon West Project Overview  \nRaghav Utopia Project will be constructed on 0.19 acre of land parcel, 1 tower with G+4P+17 floors having 2 BHK, 3 BHK premium residences.  \n  \nRaghav Utopia location  \nProject is Located Near New Link Rd, Shashtri Nagar, Goregaon West, Mumbai with -  \nBangur Nagar Metro Stn - 550m  \nSV Rd - 900m  \nWEH - 2.9km  \n  \nRaghav Utopia Goregaon West Project Amenities  \nFirst is Internal amenities -  \nVitrified Tiles, Intercom, Kitchen Platform, CCTV & many more  \n  \nRaghav Realty Goregaon West External Amenities  \nProject has amenities with likes of -  \nInfinity Swimming Pool  \nGymnasium  \nKids play Area  \nYoga Deck  \nSenior Citizen Area many more  \n  \nRaghav Realty Utopia Goregaon West Parking -  \nProject has one type of car parking facility - [...] ## Raghav Utopia Location\n\nNear New Link Rd, Shastri Nagar, Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n Bangur Nagar Metro Stn - 550m\n S.V. Rd - 900m\n WEH - 2.9km\n\n360 background\n\nHousiey Logo\n\n360\n\n## Raghav Utopia Videos\n\n## Raghav Utopia Pros & Cons\n\nPros-icon\n\nPros\n\ntoggle-arrow\n\n1.The project is located at a prime location near New Link Road, offering excellent connectivity to Bangur Nagar Metro Station, Oberoi Mall, and the Western Express Highway.\n\nCons-icon\n\nCons\n\ntoggle-arrow\n\n1.The project offers relatively small carpet areas, especially in the 2 & 3 BHK layouts. So, if you are looking for spacious apartments, this project may not be the right fit for you.\n\n## Raghav Utopia Amenities\n\n### Internal Amenities\n\nVitrified Tiles\n\nVitrified Tiles\n\nGranite Kitchen Platform\n\nGranite Kitchen Platform","score":0.79215926,"raw_content":null,"id":"0d7494-04"},{"url":"https://www.raghavutopia.co.in","title":"RAGHAV UTOPIA GOREGAON WEST | 2 & 3 BHK FLATS FOR SALE | MAHARERA PROJECT | RAGHAV UTOPIA","content":"The tower stands tall with a striking modern façade and well-planned homes that maximize natural light, ventilation, and usable space. Each residence is designed to deliver a perfect balance of functionality and aesthetics, making everyday living both convenient and refined.\n\nWith quality construction, premium finishes, and a strategic location close to key lifestyle hubs, Raghav Utopia is ideal for both end-users and long-term investors.  \nMaharera Registration No.: PR1180002501406, ensuring transparency and peace of mind.\n\n### AMENITIES: RAGHAV UTOPIA . SHASHTRI NAGAR . GOREGAON WEST\n\nRAGHAV UTOPIA GOREGAON WEST, RAGHAV UTOPIA, SHASTRI NAGAR, ROAD NO 1, GOREGAON WEST\n\nRAGHAV UTOPIA GOREGAON WEST, RAGHAV UTOPIA, SHASTRI NAGAR, ROAD NO 1, GOR